    "text": "Some of the deepest love doesn’t announce itself.⁠\n⁠\nIt lives in the rides home, the lights left on, the way someone remembered what you needed before you knew how to ask.⁠\n⁠\nAnd years later, you realize—⁠\nthey weren’t just loving you.⁠\n⁠\nThey were teaching you how to feel at home in the world.⁠\n⁠\n🖤 Thinking of the ones who raised us, stayed, and loved us quietly today.",
